  "_comment": "TinyS3[D] firmware-feature proxy on Wokwi's ESP32-S3-DevKitC-1 board using the builder-confirmed external wiring wherever the carrier exposes it: HX711 DT/SCK=21/2 with SPDT RATE (3V3=80 SPS, GND=10 SPS); shared I2C=8/9; LIS2DW12 interrupt pins unconnected; JD9853 SCLK/MOSI/MISO/DC/RST/BL=36/35/unconnected/1/4/5; AXS5106L RST/INT=7/6; sleep/tare=37/RX(GPIO44). MAX17048 ALRT remains on GPIO10 and RGB power/data on 17/18. Carrier exceptions: DevKitC does not expose physical LCD_CS GPIO34 or Tiny VBUS-sense GPIO33, so simulator-only GPIO39 and GPIO47 are used respectively. RF antenna GPIO38 remains unobservable. The custom Tiny board diagram retains the exact GPIO34/GPIO33 mapping."
